(7526032, 1202927, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, evocative image.  The hand is certainly centrally located, and crucially important, yet is beautifully integrated into the whole.  The range of blue tones is very pleasing.  I find the object, fabric, I believe, to the left of the hand to be visually cumbersome.  Perhaps it''s a visual transition or place-keeper, don''t know, maybe a handkerchief, but beyond my ken.  All in all, a tour de force.  Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful, evocative image.  The hand is certainly centrally located, and crucially important, yet is beautifully integrated into the whole.  The range of blue tones is very pleasing.  I find the object, fabric, I believe, to the left of the hand to be visually cumbersome.  Perhaps it''s a visual transition or place-keeper, don''t know, maybe a handkerchief, but beyond my ken.  All in all, a tour de force.  Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2017-07-29 10:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7526033, 1203056, 173844, '<td valign="top">Visually lush and emotionally moving, no pun intended.  The lavish overlay, often an impediment for me, heightens the mood as sort of muffled fireworks.  The hand is bold yet minimal.  A work of art.  A personal co-favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Visually lush and emotionally moving, no pun intended.  The lavish overlay, often an impediment for me, heightens the mood as sort of muffled fireworks.  The hand is bold yet minimal.  A work of art.  A personal co-favorite in the challenge.', '2017-07-29 10:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7526034, 1203057, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very engaging and open image.  Perfect lighting and moment of capture.  Only on the third go-around did I realize that it''s "musician" and not "magician", and decided to go with the latter anyway.</td>', 'Very engaging and open image.  Perfect lighting and moment of capture.  Only on the third go-around did I realize that it''s "musician" and not "magician", and decided to go with the latter anyway.', '2017-07-29 11:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7526035, 1202911, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot, honoring the challenge with a wink and a smile.  It''s really perfect.  The gray background, with a touch of filigree, is also lovely.</td>', 'Terrific shot, honoring the challenge with a wink and a smile.  It''s really perfect.  The gray background, with a touch of filigree, is also lovely.', '2017-07-29 11:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7526036, 1203079, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting, with sprightly interplay of dark and light.</td>', 'Interesting, with sprightly interplay of dark and light.', '2017-07-29 11:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
