(7527653, 1203062, 100831, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mitalapo:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t know, but it looks right. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Beauty is hardly unsuccessful.. and as I am not much for words, what <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ubique</a> said.</td>', 'Originally posted by mitalapo: I don''t know, but it looks right.   Beauty is hardly unsuccessful.. and as I am not much for words, what  Ubique said.', '2017-08-08 01:36:38.000000', NULL, 0),
